		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Gadget</strong> &middot; <em>Engineer invention powered by Toolbelt scraps. Activate for 1 scrap; spend a 2nd scrap for the Toolbelt effect. Only Engineers gain the active benefit &mdash; an ally given this gadget gains only the Passive.</em></p><hr><p><strong>Free Action (1 scrap):</strong> Gain advantage on your next roll.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt (2 scraps):</strong> Your next roll is considered 2 higher. A roll over a die's maximum is a crit.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You can see in the dark.</p>",
